    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15126" root="رخص" body-key="r">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارخصهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (God, S, A, Msb, or a man,
JK) <i>made it</i> (a thing, Msb, or a price, S, A)
<i>cheap, low-priced,</i> or <i>low.</i> (JK, S, A, Msb, K.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخَّصَهُ</span>, in this sense, is not known. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also <i>He found it to be cheap, low-priced,</i> or <i>low.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتخصهُ</span></b> , (S, A,) <i>He
bought it cheap,</i> or <i>at a low price.</i> (S, A, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also 2.

